      <h1>Introduction: Root Locus Controller Design</h1>
      <!--introduction-->
      <p>In this tutorial, we will introduce the root locus, show how to create it using MATLAB, and demonstrate how to design feedback
         controllers that satisfy certain performance criteria through the use of the root locus.
      </p>
      <p>Key MATLAB commands used in this tutorial are: <a href="http://www.mathworks.com/help/toolbox/control/ref/feedback.html"><tt>feedback</tt></a> , <a href="http://www.mathworks.com/help/control/ref/rlocus.html"><tt>rlocus</tt></a> , <a href="http://www.mathworks.com/help/toolbox/control/ref/step.html"><tt>step</tt></a> , <a href="http://www.mathworks.com/help/control/ref/controlsystemdesigner-app.html"><tt>controlSystemDesigner</tt></a></p>
 <a href="https://www.mathworks.com/campaigns/products/control-tutorials.html#root-lotus-controller-design" style="color: white" class="button"> Run Live Script Version in MATLAB Online</a>
</div>
